# Whitelist: only the public site and repo metadata are tracked.
# Everything else in this folder (raw data package, answer keys, PI-only tools,
# pi_private/ passphrases, instructions) must never be committed.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/.github/
!/site/

# defensive: never track these even if moved under site/
pi_private/
**/pi_private/
*.zip
**/gt/
